# NAME: Other-AI-Peng
# AUTHOR: Peng (split out from AI.list)
# UPDATED: 2026-10-27
# DESCRIPTION: AI services other than ChatGPT and Apple Intelligence:
#              Microsoft Copilot / Bing AI, Anthropic Claude, OpenRouter / Groq / Agnes AI,
#              and shared AI supporting infrastructure.
# NOTE: Shared AI Infrastructure section contains broad rules kept as-is; see its comment.
# FORMAT: Policy-less generic RULE-SET (compatible with Surge, Loon, Shadowrocket)

# Microsoft Copilot / Bing AI

DOMAIN,api.msn.com
DOMAIN,assets.msn.com
DOMAIN,copilot.microsoft.com
DOMAIN,gateway.bingviz.microsoft.net
DOMAIN,gateway.bingviz.microsoftapp.net
DOMAIN,location.microsoft.com
DOMAIN,odc.officeapps.live.com
DOMAIN,r.bing.com
DOMAIN,self.events.data.microsoft.com
DOMAIN,services.bingapis.com
DOMAIN,sydney.bing.com
DOMAIN,www.bing.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,api.microsoftapp.net
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,bing-shopping.microsoft-falcon.io
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,edgeservices.bing.com

# Anthropic / Claude
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,anthropic.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,claude.ai
